# Quality Suite

The quality suite standardises linting, type-checking, testing, and coverage
for this project. The type checker is **ty** (`uv run ty check`). Do not add
mypy or `mypy.ini`.

## Commands

{% if task_runner in ['just', 'both'] %}
- `just quality` – default aggregator: Ruff, ty, Pylint, pytest (via coverage),
  and optional Node checks when the Node API track is enabled.
{% endif %}
{% if task_runner in ['makefile', 'both'] %}
- `make quality` – GNU Make aggregator (present when `task_runner` is
  `makefile` or `both`).
{% endif %}
- `uv run task quality` – Taskipy fallback when aggregators are unavailable
  (`task_runner=none`). Durations land in `.riso/quality-durations.json`.
- `uv run ty check` / `{% if task_runner in ['just', 'both'] %}just typecheck{% elif task_runner == 'makefile' %}make typecheck{% else %}uv run ty check{% endif %}` – type check only.

Recipes honour `QUALITY_PROFILE` (default
`{{ quality_profile|default('standard') }}`). Set `QUALITY_PROFILE=strict` for
stricter ty and Ruff rules during local runs or CI.

## Configuration Files

- `ruff.toml`
- `pyproject.toml` (`[tool.ty]`)
- `.pylintrc`
- `coverage.cfg`

Visual tokens for docs, charts, and frontend surfaces are documented in
[DESIGN.md](../../DESIGN.md) at the project root.

## Tooling Expectations

| Tool      | Provisioning                        | Notes |
|-----------|-------------------------------------|-------|
| Ruff      | quality extra / `uv`                | Shared ignore list |
| ty        | quality extra / `uv`                | Astral type checker; stricter in `strict` profile |
| Pylint    | quality extra / `uv`                | Baseline config |
| Coverage  | quality extra                       | Reports for governance |
| pnpm lint | When Node API track is enabled      | Skipped otherwise |

## Evidence & Governance

- Local runs record durations when the quality helper writes
  `.riso/quality-durations.json`.
{% if ci_platform == 'github-actions' %}
- CI uploads logs via `.github/workflows/riso-quality.yml` and
  `.github/workflows/riso-matrix.yml` (not `quality-matrix.yml`).
{% endif %}
- `.riso/post_gen_metadata.json` records `quality_profile` (do not hand-edit).
